[](https://github.com/ardli-firman/dsh-model-search-plugin/packages)

Searchable model selector for DeepSeek Harness. Replaces the default model dropdown in the composer with a searchable version — no more scrolling through hundreds of models!

@ardli-firman/dsh-model-search README · Uninstall：```bash
dsh plugin --profile web remove @ardli-firman/dsh-model-search
```

@ardli-firman/dsh-model-search README · Clone and link for local development：git clone https://github.com/ardli-firman/dsh-model-search-plugin.git
cd dsh-model-search-plugin
dsh plugin --profile web add link:.

@ardli-firman/dsh-model-search README · Push with tags：git push && git push --tags
```

